:db/add "394794f2-0640-5017-a3b6-371d2f2b6119" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "394794f2-0640-5017-a3b6-371d2f2b6119" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select] [:db/add "394794f2-0640-5017-a3b6-371d2f2b6119" :answer-field/choices "e7c36cee-b033-54ff-a40d-732c813d9bdd"] [:db/add "394794f2-0640-5017-a3b6-371d2f2b6119" :answer-field/choices "dc52c831-c5e9-51c7-9585-b1bd03cb3d51"] [:db/add "394794f2-0640-5017-a3b6-371d2f2b6119" :answer-field/choices "634f1223-5836-5e72-b571-55fc0e61dd4b"] [:db/add "394794f2-0640-5017-a3b6-371d2f2b6119" :answer-field/choices "5a6a7d93-672d-588a-af72-5f288893e4fb"] [:db/add "394794f2-0640-5017-a3b6-371d2f2b6119" :answer-field/choices "be61dcca-c20f-59c8-b32b-197eaa09ea35"] [:db/add "394794f2-0640-5017-a3b6-371d2f2b6119" :answer-field/correct "634f1223-5836-5e72-b571-55fc0e61dd4b"] [:db/ensure "394794f2-0640-5017-a3b6-371d2f2b6119" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "2be7fd07-ba52-508f-89b0-10b9de9cd5dc" :question/id #uuid "2be7fd07-ba52-508f-89b0-10b9de9cd5dc"] [:db/add "2be7fd07-ba52-508f-89b0-10b9de9cd5dc" :question/problem "Consider the following initial value problem.\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+\\left(1\\right)y=6,\\quad y(0)=-6\n$$\n\nSelect the correct options below.\n\nAn integrating factor for this equation is $I(x)=$ {{field-1}}.\n\nThe solution to the initial value problem is $y(x)=$ {{field-2}}."] [:db/add "2be7fd07-ba52-508f-89b0-10b9de9cd5dc" :question/worked-solution "This equation is in the standard form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+P(x)y=Q(x),\n$$\n\nwith $P(x)=1$ and $Q(x)=6.$\n\nWe compute an integrating factor using the definition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I(x) & =e^{\\int P(x)\\,\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =e^{\\int 1\\,\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =e^{x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying both sides of the equation in standard form by $I(x)=e^{x}$ yields\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}e^{x}\\cdot (\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+1y) & =e^{x}\\cdot 6 \\\\ e^{x}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+e^{x}y & =6 e^{x} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(ye^{x}) & =6 e^{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we integrate with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(ye^{x})\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int 6 e^{x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ ye^{x} & =6\\left(1 e^{x}\\right)+C \\\\ ye^{x} & =6 e^{x}+C \\\\ y & =\\left(C + 6 e^{x}\\right) e^{- x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is the general solution. To find the value of $C$ corresponding to the specific solution, we apply the initial condition $y(0)=-6$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y(0) & =\\frac{(6 e^{(0)})+C}{(e^{(0)})} \\\\ -6 & =\\frac{6+C}{1} \\\\ C & =-12\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\ny=6 - 12 e^{- x}.\n$$"] [:db/add "2be7fd07-ba52-508f-89b0-10b9de9cd5dc" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "2be7fd07-ba52-508f-89b0-10b9de9cd5dc" :question/answer-fields "1fd03680-137b-5658-8661-48a69c356b78"] [:db/add "2be7fd07-ba52-508f-89b0-10b9de9cd5dc" :question/answer-fields "394794f2-0640-5017-a3b6-371d2f2b6119"] [:db/ensure "2be7fd07-ba52-508f-89b0-10b9de9cd5dc" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087879 :knowledge-point/questions "2be7fd07-ba52-508f-89b0-10b9de9cd5dc"] [:db/add "83d05d53-ffca-595b-bb52-ff5d5b9978a0" :answer/id #uuid "83d05d53-ffca-595b-bb52-ff5d5b9978a0"] [:db/add "83d05d53-ffca-595b-bb52-ff5d5b9978a0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "83d05d53-ffca-595b-bb52-ff5d5b9978a0" :answer/value "e^{6 x}"] [:db/ensure "83d05d53-ffca-595b-bb52-ff5d5b9978a0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e9fdadf8-d120-511f-af83-a87574832c96" :answer/id #uuid "e9fdadf8-d120-511f-af83-a87574832c96"] [:db/add "e9fdadf8-d120-511f-af83-a87574832c96" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e9fdadf8-d120-511f-af83-a87574832c96" :answer/value "e^{x}"] [:db/ensure "e9fdadf8-d120-511f-af83-a87574832c96" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c39a0f66-0147-59d1-bd54-e4e65a527a9d" :answer/id #uuid "c39a0f66-0147-59d1-bd54-e4e65a527a9d"] [:db/add "c39a0f66-0147-59d1-bd54-e4e65a527a9d" :answer/