 [:db/ensure "e3d1d641-b783-502e-aea7-744475d60287" :answer/validate] [:db/add "71eae54a-d93d-5657-ba12-81d85ed6cb2f" :answer/id #uuid "71eae54a-d93d-5657-ba12-81d85ed6cb2f"] [:db/add "71eae54a-d93d-5657-ba12-81d85ed6cb2f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "71eae54a-d93d-5657-ba12-81d85ed6cb2f" :answer/value "6 + 2 e^{- x}"] [:db/ensure "71eae54a-d93d-5657-ba12-81d85ed6cb2f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ae346266-244d-53af-9983-43e97f10dc99" :answer/id #uuid "ae346266-244d-53af-9983-43e97f10dc99"] [:db/add "ae346266-244d-53af-9983-43e97f10dc99" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ae346266-244d-53af-9983-43e97f10dc99" :answer/value "6 + 2 e^{- 6 x}"] [:db/ensure "ae346266-244d-53af-9983-43e97f10dc99" :answer/validate] [:db/add "abc4e823-c280-5bbf-9676-8363643a0c88" :answer/id #uuid "abc4e823-c280-5bbf-9676-8363643a0c88"] [:db/add "abc4e823-c280-5bbf-9676-8363643a0c88" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "abc4e823-c280-5bbf-9676-8363643a0c88" :answer/value "6 - 2 e^{- x}"] [:db/ensure "abc4e823-c280-5bbf-9676-8363643a0c88" :answer/validate] [:db/add "60869067-bdb9-56bd-abd1-bfcc72bc3b92" :answer-field/id #uuid "60869067-bdb9-56bd-abd1-bfcc72bc3b92"] [:db/add "60869067-bdb9-56bd-abd1-bfcc72bc3b92" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "60869067-bdb9-56bd-abd1-bfcc72bc3b92" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select] [:db/add "60869067-bdb9-56bd-abd1-bfcc72bc3b92" :answer-field/choices "8822c766-03e4-5ba0-85d8-a63cdcfbd8b7"] [:db/add "60869067-bdb9-56bd-abd1-bfcc72bc3b92" :answer-field/choices "e3d1d641-b783-502e-aea7-744475d60287"] [:db/add "60869067-bdb9-56bd-abd1-bfcc72bc3b92" :answer-field/choices "71eae54a-d93d-5657-ba12-81d85ed6cb2f"] [:db/add "60869067-bdb9-56bd-abd1-bfcc72bc3b92" :answer-field/choices "ae346266-244d-53af-9983-43e97f10dc99"] [:db/add "60869067-bdb9-56bd-abd1-bfcc72bc3b92" :answer-field/choices "abc4e823-c280-5bbf-9676-8363643a0c88"] [:db/add "60869067-bdb9-56bd-abd1-bfcc72bc3b92" :answer-field/correct "abc4e823-c280-5bbf-9676-8363643a0c88"] [:db/ensure "60869067-bdb9-56bd-abd1-bfcc72bc3b92" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "e409c971-d20d-56fa-94cd-747beaeffdaa" :question/id #uuid "e409c971-d20d-56fa-94cd-747beaeffdaa"] [:db/add "e409c971-d20d-56fa-94cd-747beaeffdaa" :question/problem "Consider the following initial value problem.\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+\\left(1\\right)y=6,\\quad y(0)=4\n$$\n\nSelect the correct options below.\n\nAn integrating factor for this equation is $I(x)=$ {{field-1}}.\n\nThe solution to the initial value problem is $y(x)=$ {{field-2}}."] [:db/add "e409c971-d20d-56fa-94cd-747beaeffdaa" :question/worked-solution "This equation is in the standard form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+P(x)y=Q(x),\n$$\n\nwith $P(x)=1$ and $Q(x)=6.$\n\nWe compute an integrating factor using the definition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I(x) & =e^{\\int P(x)\\,\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =e^{\\int 1\\,\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =e^{x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying both sides of the equation in standard form by $I(x)=e^{x}$ yields\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}e^{x}\\cdot (\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+1y) & =e^{x}\\cdot 6 \\\\ e^{x}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+e^{x}y & =6 e^{x} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(ye^{x}) & =6 e^{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we integrate with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(ye^{x})\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int 6 e^{x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ ye^{x} & =6\\left(1 e^{x}\\right)+C \\\\ ye^{x} & =6 e^{x}+C \\\\ y & =\\left(C + 6 e^{x}\\right) e^{- x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is the general solution. To find the value of $C$ corresponding to the specific solution, we apply the initial condition $y(0)=4$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y(0) & =\\frac{(6 e^{(0)})+C}{(e^{(0)})} \\\\ 4 & =\\frac{6+C}{1} \\\\ C & =-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\ny=6 - 2 e^{- x}.\n$$"] [:db/add "e409c971-d20d-56fa-94cd-747beaeffdaa" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "e409c971-d20d-56fa-94cd-747beaeffdaa" :question/answer-fields "e8be4a49-c93b-5c48-9ef1-ca4110873e26"] [:db/add "e409c971-d20d-56fa-94cd-747beaeffdaa" :question/answer-fields "60869067-bdb9-56bd-abd1-bfcc72bc3b92"] [:db/ensure "e409c971-d20d-56fa-94cd-747beaeffdaa" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087879 :knowledge-point/questions "e409c971-d20d-56fa-94cd-747beaeffdaa"] [:db/add "efaa31b2-83d1-587e-a56a-5816870b7308" :answer/id #uuid "efaa31b2-83d1-587e-a56a-5816870b7308"] [:db/add "efaa31b2-83d1-587e-a56a-5816870b7308" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "efaa31b2-83d1-587e-a56a-5816870b7308" :answer/value "e^{2 x}"] [:db/ensure "efaa31b2-83d1-587e-a56a-5816870b7308" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f4282c7c-f573-5f10-905c-8afc2b62da4c" :answer/id #uuid "f4282c7c-f573-5f10-905c-8afc2b62da4c"] [:db/add "f4282c7c-f573-5f10-905c-8afc2b62da4c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f4282c7c-f573-5f10-905c-8afc2b62da4c" :answer/value "e^{5 x}"] [:db/ensure "f4282c7c-f573-5f10-905c-8afc2b62da4c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "50f6809e-3449-5201-b528-2c9007919ce2" :answer/id #uuid "50f6809e-3449-5201-b528-2c9007919ce2"] [:db/add "50f6809e-3449-5201-b528-2c9007919ce2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "50f6809e-3449-5201-b528-2c9007919ce2" :answer/value "e^{4 x}"] [:db/ensure "50f6809e-3449-5201-b528-2c9007919ce2" :answer/validate] [:db/add "135074be-7da3-5da5-b0c5-b10ef4619d1c" :answer/id #uuid "135074be-7da3-5da5-b0c5-b10ef4619d1c"] [:db/add "135074be-7da3-5da5-b0c5-b10ef4619d1c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "135074be-7da3-5da5-b0c5-b10ef4619d1c" :answer/value "e^{x}"] [:db/ensure "135074be-7da3-5da5-b0c5-b10ef4619d1c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d7581006-fbf5-5717-bdf7-e4a08b45f602" :answer-field/id #uuid "d7581006-fbf5-5717-bdf7-e4a08b45f602"] [:db/add "d7581006-fbf5-5717-bdf7-e4a08b45f602" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "d7581006-fbf5-5717-bdf7-e4a08b45f602" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select] [:db/add "d7581006-fbf5-5717-bdf7-e4a08b45f602"