 [:db/add "e03e3cb6-cb28-5eb3-94cf-3bfc038afaa7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e03e3cb6-cb28-5eb3-94cf-3bfc038afaa7" :answer/value "5 + e^{- x}"] [:db/ensure "e03e3cb6-cb28-5eb3-94cf-3bfc038afaa7" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a20012af-64a2-52c1-adef-f04b7083aa3e" :answer-field/id #uuid "a20012af-64a2-52c1-adef-f04b7083aa3e"] [:db/add "a20012af-64a2-52c1-adef-f04b7083aa3e" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "a20012af-64a2-52c1-adef-f04b7083aa3e" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select] [:db/add "a20012af-64a2-52c1-adef-f04b7083aa3e" :answer-field/choices "7f6b0c80-48ea-506b-9892-ddc3687007cf"] [:db/add "a20012af-64a2-52c1-adef-f04b7083aa3e" :answer-field/choices "3071ecc1-e64e-5cac-a471-3ca89216c63b"] [:db/add "a20012af-64a2-52c1-adef-f04b7083aa3e" :answer-field/choices "13a1e929-4a96-5b6d-b801-5e7a868c5754"] [:db/add "a20012af-64a2-52c1-adef-f04b7083aa3e" :answer-field/choices "14101e14-8be8-5a83-8159-4b120f92de63"] [:db/add "a20012af-64a2-52c1-adef-f04b7083aa3e" :answer-field/choices "e03e3cb6-cb28-5eb3-94cf-3bfc038afaa7"] [:db/add "a20012af-64a2-52c1-adef-f04b7083aa3e" :answer-field/correct "e03e3cb6-cb28-5eb3-94cf-3bfc038afaa7"] [:db/ensure "a20012af-64a2-52c1-adef-f04b7083aa3e" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "852b8f65-dbea-5a61-8fbd-222055e2893b" :question/id #uuid "852b8f65-dbea-5a61-8fbd-222055e2893b"] [:db/add "852b8f65-dbea-5a61-8fbd-222055e2893b" :question/problem "Consider the following initial value problem.\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+\\left(1\\right)y=5,\\quad y(0)=6\n$$\n\nSelect the correct options below.\n\nAn integrating factor for this equation is $I(x)=$ {{field-1}}.\n\nThe solution to the initial value problem is $y(x)=$ {{field-2}}."] [:db/add "852b8f65-dbea-5a61-8fbd-222055e2893b" :question/worked-solution "This equation is in the standard form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+P(x)y=Q(x),\n$$\n\nwith $P(x)=1$ and $Q(x)=5.$\n\nWe compute an integrating factor using the definition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I(x) & =e^{\\int P(x)\\,\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =e^{\\int 1\\,\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =e^{x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying both sides of the equation in standard form by $I(x)=e^{x}$ yields\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}e^{x}\\cdot (\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+1y) & =e^{x}\\cdot 5 \\\\ e^{x}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+e^{x}y & =5 e^{x} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(ye^{x}) & =5 e^{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we integrate with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(ye^{x})\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int 5 e^{x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ ye^{x} & =5\\left(1 e^{x}\\right)+C \\\\ ye^{x} & =5 e^{x}+C \\\\ y & =\\left(C + 5 e^{x}\\right) e^{- x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is the general solution. To find the value of $C$ corresponding to the specific solution, we apply the initial condition $y(0)=6$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y(0) & =\\frac{(5 e^{(0)})+C}{(e^{(0)})} \\\\ 6 & =\\frac{5+C}{1} \\\\ C & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\ny=5 + e^{- x}.\n$$"] [:db/add "852b8f65-dbea-5a61-8fbd-222055e2893b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "852b8f65-dbea-5a61-8fbd-222055e2893b" :question/answer-fields "d7581006-fbf5-5717-bdf7-e4a08b45f602"] [:db/add "852b8f65-dbea-5a61-8fbd-222055e2893b" :question/answer-fields "a20012af-64a2-52c1-adef-f04b7083aa3e"] [:db/ensure "852b8f65-dbea-5a61-8fbd-222055e2893b" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087879 :knowledge-point/questions "852b8f65-dbea-5a61-8fbd-222055e2893b"] [:db/add "0708b154-c83e-5ed5-884d-b08f73b1d89b" :answer/id #uuid "0708b154-c83e-5ed5-884d-b08f73b1d89b"] [:db/add "0708b154-c83e-5ed5-884d-b08f73b1d89b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0708b154-c83e-5ed5-884d-b08f73b1d89b" :answer/value "e^{6 x}"] [:db/ensure "0708b154-c83e-5ed5-884d-b08f73b1d89b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "731e00ab-20b5-5027-bc63-b2ab1dca5b61" :answer/id #uuid "731e00ab-20b5-5027-bc63-b2ab1dca5b61"] [:db/add "731e00ab-20b5-5027-bc63-b2ab1dca5b61" :a